  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Failure is not the problem. You are the problem.",
      "start": 1.49,
      "end": 6.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me explain.",
      "start": 7.31,
      "end": 8.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I think that there's a part of you with the hidden power, a hidden strength,",
      "start": 9.63,
      "end": 15.17
    },
    {
      "text": "that realizes that there is no such thing as",
      "start": 15.45,
      "end": 19.28
    },
    {
      "text": "failure. There's no such thing as catastrophe.",
      "start": 19.81,
      "end": 22.59
    },
    {
      "text": "Because what might look like to another person as catastrophe,",
      "start": 23.17,
      "end": 27.51
    },
    {
      "text": "you could realize that is actually an opportunity for you to create the life that you desire,",
      "start": 27.51,
      "end": 33.85
    },
    {
      "text": "that pushes you forward to that dream life fantasy that you've always wanted.",
      "start": 34.21,
      "end": 39.51
    },
    {
      "text": "So here is how we're going to do that.",
      "start": 40.25,
      "end": 42.03
    }
  ]
}